---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../components/CTABlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Work — Heurystics"
  description="Case studies: 8 AI operations running a 100+ agent brokerage and a 5-location retail chain. Commission errors eliminated, manual work automated, full systems live in weeks."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <h1 class="fade-up">Two businesses that stopped running operations manually.</h1>
      <p class="lead fade-up delay-1" style="margin-top: 16px;">
        A real estate brokerage and a multi-location retail chain.
        Different industries, same problem: manual work scaling faster than the team.
        Same outcome: AI running the operations 24/7.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Case 1: Real Estate Brokerage -->
  <section class="section case-section" id="case-1">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-header fade-up">
        <span class="eyebrow">REAL ESTATE BROKERAGE &middot; 100+ AGENTS &middot; CALIFORNIA</span>
        <h2>8 AI operations replaced the entire back-office. Live in 6 weeks.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="case-challenge fade-up delay-1">
        <h4>The situation</h4>
        <p>
          A growing brokerage with 100+ agents, multiple offices, and a 200-unit property management
          portfolio. Their operations couldn't keep up with their growth. Back-office staff were tracking
          hundreds of deal deadlines in spreadsheets, reconciling commissions by hand, chasing documents
          across email threads, and compiling monthly reports that were stale before they were finished.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="case-pain-grid fade-up delay-2">
        <div class="case-pain-item">
          <span class="case-pain-stat stat-number">$100K-250K</span>
          <span class="case-pain-label">lost annually to commission errors</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-pain-item">
          <span class="case-pain-stat stat-number">20-25 hrs/week</span>
          <span class="case-pain-label">spent manually tracking deal deadlines</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-pain-item">
          <span class="case-pain-stat stat-number">8-10 hours</span>
          <span class="case-pain-label">of admin per new listing launch</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-pain-item">
          <span class="case-pain-stat stat-number">60-70%</span>
          <span class="case-pain-label">of CRM data was stale or incomplete</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-solution fade-up">
        <h4>What we did</h4>
        <p>We deployed 8 specialized AI operations — each one handling a critical function autonomously, running 24/7, and escalating to humans only when needed.</p>

        <div class="case-ops-grid">
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Deal management</h5>
            <p>Reads every incoming contract, extracts all deadlines, tracks 40+ concurrent deals, sends escalating reminders, flags problems before they kill a deal.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Cost dropped to $12-25 per deal. One saved deal pays for a full year.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Commission reconciliation</h5>
            <p>Calculates exact splits for every deal — every override, cap, team share, referral fee — cross-checks against title company disbursements, pushes clean entries to accounting.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Eliminated the 2-5% error rate. $20K+/year recovered in month one.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Listing launches</h5>
            <p>Takes a signed listing and fires the entire marketing sequence — MLS description, photographer, social posts, email campaigns, property website — all in minutes.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">30-40 hours/month saved per agent team.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Compliance monitoring</h5>
            <p>Continuously monitors license expirations, insurance renewals, continuing education, and scans all communications for regulatory violations.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Multiple violations caught early. One avoided complaint saves $50K-500K.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Lead intelligence</h5>
            <p>Enriches every CRM record overnight — property history, estimated equity, life event signals — generates a personalized briefing before every scheduled call.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Response rates jumped from 1-2% to 8-12%.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Property management</h5>
            <p>Handles the entire 200-unit portfolio: tenant screening, maintenance triage, vendor dispatch, lease renewals, rent collection.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Replaced 1-2 FTE admin staff. 15-20% reduction in vacancy rates.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Market analysis</h5>
            <p>Generates professional, branded CMAs in 30 minutes — pulling live MLS data, running comparable analysis, delivering a finished PDF.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">12-20 hours/week saved per listing agent.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Business intelligence</h5>
            <p>Pulls data from every system daily. Real-time dashboards, predictive alerts for agent churn risk and shifting markets, weekly automated briefing ranked by financial impact.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Preventing one agent departure saves $10K-25K.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-results-block fade-up">
        <h4>The numbers</h4>
        <div class="case-before-after">
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Commission errors</span><span class="ba-before">2-5% of revenue lost</span><span class="ba-after">Near zero</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Deal deadline tracking</span><span class="ba-before">20-25 hrs/week manual</span><span class="ba-after">Fully automated</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Listing launch time</span><span class="ba-before">8-10 hours each</span><span class="ba-after">Minutes</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">CRM data quality</span><span class="ba-before">60-70% stale</span><span class="ba-after">Daily enrichment</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Property mgmt staffing</span><span class="ba-before">2 FTE admin</span><span class="ba-after">1 person + AI</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">CMA turnaround</span><span class="ba-before">3-5 hours</span><span class="ba-after">30 minutes</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Business reporting</span><span class="ba-before">Monthly, 1 day to compile</span><span class="ba-after">Real-time</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="case-total">
          <div class="case-total-item">
            <span class="stat-number" style="font-size: 28px; color: var(--ochre);">$200K-400K</span>
            <span>annual value delivered</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-total-item">
            <span class="stat-number" style="font-size: 28px; color: var(--ochre);">$60K-80K</span>
            <span>total annual system cost</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-total-item">
            <span class="stat-number" style="font-size: 28px; color: var(--ochre);">3-5x</span>
            <span>ROI in year one</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="case-note">First operations live in 2 weeks. Full system deployed in 6 weeks. All data stays on their infrastructure.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Case 2: Pharmacy Retail Chain -->
  <section class="section case-section" id="case-2" style="background: var(--parchment);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-header fade-up">
        <span class="eyebrow">MULTI-LOCATION RETAIL &middot; 5+ STORES &middot; CALIFORNIA</span>
        <h2>5 stores. 8 AI operations. Every location running on one system in 12 weeks.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="case-challenge fade-up delay-1">
        <h4>The situation</h4>
        <p>
          A fast-growing pharmacy retail chain operating 5+ locations with thousands of active customers
          across in-store, web, and mobile channels. Every store was its own silo. Pricing drifted between
          locations with no one noticing. Inventory was tracked manually per store. Vendor management was
          email chains and spreadsheets. Marketing was one-size-fits-all with no attribution. Leadership
          couldn't answer basic performance questions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="case-solution fade-up">
        <h4>What we did</h4>
        <p>We built the core operations platform first — POS, user management, order tracking, store configuration — then deployed 8 AI operations on top that run the business.</p>

        <div class="case-ops-grid">
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Pricing compliance</h5>
            <p>Watches every product across every store. Detects discrepancies in real time, auto-corrects minor drift, escalates significant deviations to store managers.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Pricing inconsistencies eliminated. Compliance became continuous.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Inventory intelligence</h5>
            <p>Syncs every 60 minutes across all locations. Tracks sell-through rates, fires alerts before stockouts, flags items stuck in back-of-house that should be on shelves.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Stockouts dropped significantly. Restocking became predictive.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Vendor operations</h5>
            <p>Manages the entire vendor lifecycle autonomously. Auto-generates credit reports, tracks promotional agreements, measures promotion performance, alerts on contract renewals.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Vendor management went from email chains to fully automated.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Campaign orchestration</h5>
            <p>Runs AI-powered customer segmentation, deploys multi-channel campaigns (SMS, email, push, direct mail), tracks ROI per campaign, optimizes budget allocation.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">First-ever segmented, multi-channel campaigns with full attribution.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Demand forecasting</h5>
            <p>Predicts what will sell, where, and when. Feeds predictions into inventory for automated restock and into marketing for timed promotions.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Leadership stopped reacting to last month. Started planning for next month.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-op">
            <h5>Personalization + support</h5>
            <p>Personalized product recommendations across all channels. AI-handled support for routine inquiries. Review responses drafted and posted automatically.</p>
            <span class="case-op-result">Engagement and basket sizes increased. Support response time: days to hours.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-results-block fade-up">
        <h4>The numbers</h4>
        <div class="case-before-after">
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Pricing compliance</span><span class="ba-before">Quarterly manual audits</span><span class="ba-after">24/7 autonomous</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Inventory visibility</span><span class="ba-before">Manual per-store tracking</span><span class="ba-after">Real-time + predictive alerts</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Vendor management</span><span class="ba-before">Email chains, no audit trail</span><span class="ba-after">Fully automated lifecycle</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Marketing</span><span class="ba-before">Broadcast, no attribution</span><span class="ba-after">Segmented, multi-channel, attributed</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">Customer data</span><span class="ba-before">3 separate silos</span><span class="ba-after">Unified profiles across channels</span></div>
          <div class="ba-row"><span class="ba-label">New store onboarding</span><span class="ba-before">Weeks</span><span class="ba-after">Days</span></div>
        </div>

        <p class="case-note">Core platform live in 4 weeks. All 8 operations deployed over 12 weeks. New locations now onboard in days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why this matters -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 640px; text-align: center;">
      <p class="lead fade-up" style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">
        Two different industries. Same approach: map the workflows that are eating time and money,
        build AI that handles them, deploy on their infrastructure, measure the results.
        Whether you're running a brokerage, a retail chain, or any multi-location operation —
        the pattern is the same.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABlock />

</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .case-section { padding: 72px 0; }

  .case-header { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .case-header h2 { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 720px; }

  .case-challenge { margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 720px; }
  .case-challenge h4 { font-size: 14px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--ochre); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .case-challenge p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--driftwood); line-height: 1.75; }

  .case-pain-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .case-pain-item { background: var(--navy); padding: 20px; border-radius: 3px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .case-pain-stat { font-size: 20px; color: var(--ochre); }
  .case-pain-label { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

  .case-solution { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .case-solution > h4 { font-size: 14px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--ochre); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .case-solution > p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--driftwood); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 24px; }

  .case-ops-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .case-op { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--limestone); border-radius: 3px; background: var(--nordic-light); }
  .case-op h5 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .case-op p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--driftwood); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .case-op-result { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ochre); display: block; }

  .case-results-block h4 { font-size: 14px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--ochre); margin-bottom: 16px; }

  .case-before-after { border: 1px solid var(--limestone); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .ba-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; padding: 12px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--limestone); font-size: 14px; }
  .ba-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .ba-label { font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); }
  .ba-before { color: var(--sandstone); }
  .ba-after { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 500; }

  .case-total { display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .case-total-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .case-total-item span:last-child { font-size: 12px; color: var(--driftwood); }

  .case-note { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--sandstone); }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .case-pain-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .case-ops-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .case-pain-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ba-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; padding: 16px 20px; }
    .ba-before::before { content: 'Before: '; font-weight: 500; color: var(--driftwood); }
    .ba-after::before { content: 'After: '; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ochre); }
    .case-total { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  }
</style>
